  <AltText>
    This year's pride art. It features one of our OC's, Okimi Shinogawa, against an off-white background. She is holding down the intersex pride flag, and ve is wearing a dress that is the lesbian pride flag. She is also wearing three glowsticks, one for each of her headmates.
